OL,3,GNEWSADriver wrecks #260k Ferrari
OL,4,Asupercar in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ferrari supercar has been left a
OL,7,Fmangled wreck after its driver lost
OL,8,Fcontrol in wet conditions.
OL,10,FThe red Ferrari 296, which are
OL,11,Fgenerally sold brand new for a starting
OL,12,Fprice of between #240,000 and #260,000
OL,13,Fbefore optional extras, was crushed in
OL,14,Fthe crash on the M602 in Salford on
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police said
OL,18,F"luckily" the driver had escaped
OL,19,Finjury.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
