OL,3,GNEWSADriver wrecks #260k Ferrari
OL,4,Asupercar in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bonnet of the high performance car
OL,7,Fwas crushed into a pile of mangled
OL,8,Fmetal, with one of the front wheels
OL,9,Ftwisted out of shape, while the other
OL,10,Fhad completely snapped away.
